BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event_316748476@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T063547Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261018T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261018T190000
SUMMARY:Sunday Board Games - Dice Saloon
DESCRIPTION:Brighton Pub Boardgamers\nNewcomers welcome!\n\nCost is £3 to
  cover table booking\, no need to sign up on the meet-up\, but you NEED to
  book a ticket from Dice Saloon for the right date here: https://dicesaloo
 n.co.uk/collections/events#url\n\nThere are no specific covid rules\, but 
 please don't come if you're ill!\n\nWe play a variety of games from co-op\
 , strategy\, social deduction\, deck-building\, dungeon crawlers\, worker 
 placements\, exploration horror and longer Euro games. If you have somethi
 ng you specifically want to play it's best to ask in the Discord: [https:/
 /discord.gg/b43zV4XNjQ](https://discord.gg/b43zV4XNjQ) in the #sun-irl-mee
 tup channel.\n\nDice Saloon has a large library of games we can use\, but 
 you can bring your own games too.\n\nFeel free to also join the Brighton P
 ub Board Gamers [discord channel](https://discord.gg/b43zV4XNjQ) for more 
 in person and online events!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/brighton-pub-boardgamers/events/31674
 8476/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260928T131951Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T131951Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event_316766943@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T063547Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261019T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261019T220000
SUMMARY:Beginner + Advanced Werewolf
DESCRIPTION:Brighton Pub Boardgamers\nWerewolf is a type of social deducti
 on game like Blood on the Clocktower or The Spawn or the Traitors. It's a 
 social/party game (a bit like a murder mystery)\, you're secretly either a
  villager or a wolf\, and trying to figure out what everyone else is. Who'
 s on your team\, and who's not? Deduction\, bluffing\, and lots of feeling
  confused about who's who. Trying to work out what's going on whilst keepi
 ng your team from being bitten by wolves or burned at the stake by the vil
 lage is what beings people back week after week. We'll be running two game
 s simultaneously\, a base game and an advanced game.\n\nNew players are ve
 ry welcome! Just RSVP to let us know you are coming. If you've never playe
 d before\, don't worry\, we will get you started in our beginner friendly 
 base game! We'll explain the rules\, go through the roles with you and ass
 ign you a beginner buddy to play with you but we usually have several new 
 players every week so you won't ever be alone!\n\nEnter the pub using the 
 entrance door on the right and we will be there straight ahead of you. We 
 begin arriving around 6pm to set up and brief newbies on the rules. First 
 game usually starts around 6.30pm and a second game typically kicks off be
 tween 8 - 8.30pm. If you're going to be late\, please comment on here to l
 et us know so the moderator knows to add you in to the game. If you arrive
  after we've started you're able to sit and watch the drama unfold.\n\nBAS
 E GAME RULES:\n[Click here to learn the rules and see the roles.](https://
 drive.google.com/file/d/0B_FZ44Cve4qcbHdrRUczbmxscG8/view?usp=sharing&reso
 urcekey=0-sMA5bPaahVko7C9VF2R22A)\nThese are the rules we use for our begi
 nner friendly base games. We'll go through these at the start of each sess
 ion so don't worry about memorising all of the roles and we'll provide you
  with a sheet you can use during the game to refer back to when needed. Th
 e best way to learn is definitely just to play so come give it a go!\n\nAD
 VANCED ROLES:\n[HIDDEN MOTIVES RULES](https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_F
 Z44Cve4qcX2ZCVERlSlRJeDQ/view?usp=sharing&resourcekey=0-bt1Uvc6ftuMlG5KB2d
 KXtA)\n[DARKEST NIGHT RULES](https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_FZ44Cve4qc
 Y3FXYVRPaXRvanM/view?usp=sharing&resourcekey=0-sgA01fiWEElZv2H-oo9NvA)\nTh
 e advanced games may draw roles from either of the above but may also cont
 ain roles the moderator ahs created themselves! Or roles other mods have m
 ade previously or even one of the spicy new scenarios the creator has made
 . Turn up on the day and find out what's being played that day.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/brighton-pub-boardgamers/events/31676
 6943/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260929T172408Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T172408Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event_315678967@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T063547Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T230000
SUMMARY:Tuesday West Hove/Portslade Boardgames Meet
DESCRIPTION:Brighton Pub Boardgamers\nOur weekly Tuesday evening West Hove
 /Portslade boardgames meetup at The Railway Inn\, Portslade (just by the t
 rain station).\n\nWhether this is all new to you\, or you're a veteran of 
 Twilight Imperium\, come along\, bring a game if you want\, have fun. We p
 lay modern board games\, anything from quick fillers of Love Letter and Co
 denames\, to heavier euro games and all sorts. Please RSVP here so we have
  an idea of numbers.\n\n6:30pm onwards\, expect games to start around 7pm 
 (you can arrive later\, but you may have to wait for a game). Please buy s
 ome [food](https://www.therailwayinnportslade.co.uk/menu) or drink to cont
 ribute to our use of the space\, and don't bring food or drink in from els
 ewhere. We'll be in the function room or mezzanine area (just ask at the b
 ar).\n\nCome join our [Discord ](https://discord.gg/b43zV4XNjQ)to chat abo
 ut games and plan what to play: [https://discord.gg/b43zV4XNjQ](https://di
 scord.gg/b43zV4XNjQ)\n\nThe pub is close to several Brighton bus routes an
 d Portslade train station. If you're driving\, resident-only permit restri
 ctions stop at 7pm (see [zones X and L on this map](https://www.brighton-h
 ove.gov.uk/parking-zones)).\n\nAccessibility: There are a few steps to nav
 igate inside the pub (no more than 8). We are usually in the back 'Platfor
 m' room\, which has flat access via the side gate and ramp. Occasionally t
 he venue may have another paid event booking\, and if so we may be moved i
 nto the mezzanine\, which unfortunately is not wheelchair accessible - so 
 if you need step free access please contact an organiser. The accessible W
 C is located in the main bar (via the side door) which has a small ramped 
 access in the threshold.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/brighton-pub-boardgamers/events/31567
 8967/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260714T120205Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260714T120205Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event_316592853@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T063547Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261021T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261021T230000
SUMMARY:Wednesday Night Pub Board Games
DESCRIPTION:Brighton Pub Boardgamers\nBoardgames and a pub\, what's not to
  like? Come along and play some games with a friendly bunch of gamers. New
  faces and veterans welcome!\n\nKey info\n\n* **Arrive after 6pm** \\-\\- 
 we start from 6pm\\\, but you're welcome to turn up at any time after that
  \\(though you may have to wait/spectate for a bit later on\\)\\.\n* **Bri
 ng ID** \\-\\- the pub can be very keen to check ID for age\\\, so if you'
 re lucky enough to look under 25 in dim light\\\, please bring some\\!\n* 
 **Bring games if you can\,** all games are provided by people who attend\,
  so if you can bring them (and share/teach) that would be much appreciated
 \, but there will be plenty if not.\n* **RSVP here** please\, so we can ga
 uge numbers\n* **Buy drinks and/or food to support the pub** please\, as t
 hey let us use their space for free and means we can keep this event free!
 \n* **When you arrive\, say hello** and we'll help you find a table to joi
 n.\n\nBefore you come\, you might want to join our Discord\; we use this f
 or text chat to arrange beforehand what games to play and so on (we also p
 lay online board games there). It's also a great place for general chatter
 .\n\n[Click here to join our Discord](https://discord.gg/b43zV4XNjQ).\n\nI
 f you'd like to play a game that needs more than one table\, make sure you
  let us know here or on Discord\, and we'll see what we can do - no guaran
 tees!\n\nWe look forward to seeing you!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/brighton-pub-boardgamers/events/31659
 2853/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260917T072956Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T072956Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event_316993838@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T063547Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261022T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261022T220000
SUMMARY:Thursday Night Pub Boardgames
DESCRIPTION:Brighton Pub Boardgamers\nCome and play some games\, with a fr
 iendly bunch of people. New faces and veteran players very welcome!\n\nNow
 \, first the public service announcements\;\n\n* Please RSVP if you're pla
 nning on coming\, so we have a good idea of numbers and can reserve extra 
 tables if needed.\n* Secondly\, PLEASE don't attend if you are experiencin
 g symptoms of Covid (or similar infectious conditions\, like a cold or flu
 ). Playing boardgames does involve sitting at the same table together and 
 often means touching the same game components\, so we expect attendees to 
 take suitable precautions.\n\nAnd now on to the good bit!\nWe play all sor
 ts of games\, so come along and bring your favourite. We're always happy t
 o teach and we love it if you're up for teaching/leading some games as wel
 l!\n\nPeople usually trickle in between 6:30 and 7\, so we normally chat/p
 lay short games until around 7PM\, so if you're going to be later then tha
 t\, give us a shout on here\, or on our Discord server and we will try to 
 keep a space in a board game free for you.\n\nOur Discord server: [https:/
 /discord.gg/d3CSw82MFa](https://discord.gg/d3CSw82MFa)\n\nHope to see you 
 there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/brighton-pub-boardgamers/events/31699
 3838/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261015T122210Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T122210Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
